Presenting two papers today, come say hi!
@oneill_c will give an oral talk on our method for interpretable embedding search at 4:15 at FM4S (West 202-204)
I’ll present a poster on feature emergence and hierarchy in SAEs from 11:20-12:20 at SciForDL (West 205-207)

1. We study arXiv paper abstract embeddings, useful in RAG/semantic search. By training SAEs to reconstruct embeddings, we can not only interpret latent features but also steer them toward/away from specific concepts.
